Package: WinMO
Type: Package
Title: Estimation and Inference for Win Estimands for Hierarchical Ordinal Endpoints Under Missing Data
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Yi Liu
Maintainer: Yi Liu <yi.liu.biostat@gmail.com>
Description: Implements IPW and AIPW estimators for win/loss/tie probabilities
    and derived win estimands (WR, WO, NB, DOOR) for 1--3 hierarchical ordinal
    endpoints subject to missing data. Provides influence-function based
    variance estimation and delta-method standard errors.
